					<cleanupTick>16129440</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>You've learned of an ancient complex nearby. It is said to contain information about &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;.

If you can break into the structure and hack the computers inside, you can collect the information.

Watch out - there may be all manner of dangers inside, and other enemies may also be attracted by activity at the structure.</description>
