					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>You've detected a logging work site nearby controlled by &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Cheda Coalition&lt;/color&gt;.

If you wish, you can raid the camp to collect loot (wood x1449). If you do, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Cheda Coalition&lt;/color&gt; will become hostile.

