					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>12567987</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>Baroness &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Galla Aspietes&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to commemorate the nose of her aunt.

The monument is 14 x 22 in size and will require these resources (total value $2242):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x1010
  - Any of: Stony x625
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x856
    - Granite blocks x856
    - Limestone blocks x856
    - Slate blocks x856
    - Marble blocks x856

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;28 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task. You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.

If the monument is destroyed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; days of construction, your relations with &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; will fall by -10.</description>
					<root>BuildMonument_Basic</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
