					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>Count &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Justin Kourtikos&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to honor his father.

The monument is 17 x 14 in size and will require these resources (total value $1616):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x760
  - Any of: Stony x500
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x536
    - Granite blocks x536
    - Limestone blocks x536
    - Slate blocks x536
    - Marble blocks x536

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;21 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;35 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the count's enforcement system will activate and a mech cluster will land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; containing:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 centipede blaster&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 centipede gunner&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 militors&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;3 pikemen&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 scorcher&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 auto mortar&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 count-down activator&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 proximity activators&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;5 mech nodes&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech high-shield&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech assembler&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;3 auto charge turrets&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 auto inferno turret&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 mini-slugger turrets&lt;/color&gt;

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
					<root>BuildMonument_TimeProtect</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
