					<cleanupTick>17537314</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Freda 'Bunny' Yee&lt;/color&gt;, Ethical Chair of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt;, is making a request. She wants you to take care of 3 huskies at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;6 days&lt;/color&gt;. 

The huskies are suffering from paralytic abasia and must be kept in bed.

The huskies are necessary for &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; to fulfill an important trade promise. To provoke conflict, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Jaguars&lt;/color&gt; is sending pirates after them. If you accept the huskies, there will be (*Threat)a raid(/Threat) of strength 2x and roughly this size:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 boss&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;5 elite mercenaries&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 heavy mercenaries&lt;/color&gt;
