						<leaderTitleMale>Ethical Dog</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Ethical Dog</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The prey people can teach you things even as they die under your knife. One old lady taught me that the animals are our partners in this world, and it's wrong to treat them as any less. It became so clear after I finally ripped the metal from my body and peeled away the filthy tattooed skin."

  - &lt;i&gt;A Pure Life&lt;/i&gt; by Roque 'Rocko' Perez</description>
